You know, that is shaped by the future narrator that becomes a little movie and these little tricks, the little tricks of the office, the little bag of tricks of how much your mother, those things that set it aside from every other show, those are the reasons these shows still speak to people 20 years later, I think, right?
你知道，这是由未来的叙述者塑造的，成为一部小电影，这些小把戏，办公室的小把戏，你母亲的小把戏，这些把它与其他节目区分开来的东西，这些就是这些节目在 20 年后仍然能与人们对话的原因，我想，对吧？

