and every variable had to be right, it had to be that gym, it had to be that Pam, Josh had to be Ted, Kobe had to be Robin, like the number of variables, it's daunting the infinite how many things have to go right to create the show that becomes somebody's comfort show.
每个变量都必须是正确的，必须是那个健身房，必须是帕姆，乔希必须是泰德，科比必须是罗宾，就像变量的数量一样，有多少事情必须正确才能创造出成为某人安慰秀的节目，这是令人畏惧的。

